Manifest.toml
# ...except the generator's: gen/generate.jl's output is checked in and verified
# byte-for-byte, so the whole formatter dependency tree has to be pinned.
!gen/Manifest.toml
# ...and the examples': D2 pins the example stack so a Genie upgrade cannot
# redden a PR. The weekly drift job resolves without it, on purpose.
!examples/Manifest.toml
# Documenter's output. Regenerated by every `docs/make.jl`.
docs/build/
# Screenshots, traces and videos the examples write while demonstrating the
# milestone-4 artifact API.
examples/output/
*.png
.CondaPkg/
# Traces, video and PDF written by the milestone-4 tests. Binaries, and
# regenerated on every run — never worth committing.
artifacts/
